---
title: Migration planning foundations
date: '2026-06-16'
tags:
  - added
summary: Early schema, mapping, and sample-preview foundations for planning a migration. Live app-to-app execution is still under development.
---
Dataferry's early work established a migration draft, catalog-backed schemas,
proposed field mappings, and deterministic transforms for **sample records**.
The preview lets an operator inspect a proposed shape before any destination
write.

AI mapping suggestions depend on a configured worker and model. The sample
preview does not connect to a source or destination app. Live extraction,
loading, destination verification, and resumable execution remain future work.

*Editorial correction, 25 September 2026:* the original note described an
end-to-end migration path and queue-backed execution. Those claims exceeded
the verified product. This note now records the narrower planning capability.
